OL,3,GNEWSAFlower farms flourish as buyers
OL,4,Afavour homegrown
OL,5,
OL,6,FRising demand for homegrown cut flowers
OL,7,Fhas prompted a proliferation of
OL,8,Fbusinesses in south-west England.
OL,10,FTrade body Flowers from the Farm said
OL,11,Fabout 240 of its 1,100 members were
OL,12,Ffrom Devon, Cornwall and Somerset, in a
OL,13,Fsector it estimated brought #30m a year
OL,14,Fto the UK economy.
OL,16,FGeorgie Newbery set up the organisation
OL,17,Fafter starting her own flower business
OL,18,Fand watching the industry grow. She
OL,19,Fsaid there had been a "huge increase in
OL,20,Fdemand for locally grown flowers".
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
